{#
  The Courrier panel of a booking (§7.7): the emails that arrived about
  this stay, and what the module is not sure about.

  Three things this panel is deliberate about:

  - **The origin of every attachment is shown.** A message attached because
    its subject carried the reference is a near-certainty; one attached
    because the sender's address matched inside a time window is a guess.
    Presenting both as simply "attached" would let a manager act on the
    second with the confidence of the first.
  - **Propositions are answered here**, by the manager of the booking. A
    proposition only exists to be confirmed or dismissed by somebody who
    knows, and until this panel showed them only the Chef d'Unité could.
  - **Remote images are already gone** from the bodies below — a hidden
    image in a stranger's email is a read receipt, and it was stripped when
    the message was stored, not when it is rendered.

  Requires `asset`, `booking`, `messages`, `message_propositions`,
  `message_documents` and `move_targets`.
#}
<div class="card mb-4" id="communications">
    <div class="card-body">
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 mb-2">
            <h2 class="h5 mb-0">Courrier</h2>
            <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/message/relancer">
                {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary"
                        title="Réexamine les messages que rien ne rattache, avec ce que le site sait aujourd'hui">
                    <i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise" aria-hidden="true"></i> Relancer l'analyse
                </button>
            </form>
        </div>
        <p class="text-body-secondary small">
            Les e-mails reçus au sujet de cette réservation, rattachés automatiquement.
            ScoutMagic lit la boîte de l'unité sans jamais la modifier : rien n'y est
            marqué comme lu, déplacé ni supprimé.
        </p>

        {% if message_propositions is not empty %}
            <h3 class="h6 mt-3">Propositions à confirmer</h3>
            {% for row in message_propositions %}
                <div class="border border-warning rounded p-3 mb-3">
                    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between gap-2">
                        <div class="min-w-0">
                            <strong>{{ row.message.displayFrom }}</strong>
                            <div class="form-text mb-0">{{ row.message.sentAt|datetime_fr }}</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="fw-semibold my-2">{{ row.message.subject ?: 'Sans objet' }}</div>
                    {% include '@inbound_mail/partials/message_body.html.twig' with { message: row.message, folded: true } only %}
                    {% if row.message.hasAttachments or row.message.hasOmittedAttachments %}
                        <div class="mt-2">
                            {% include '@inbound_mail/partials/attachments.html.twig' with { message: row.message } only %}
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                    {% for candidate in row.candidates %}
                        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 mt-3">
                            <div class="small">{{ candidate.explanation }}</div>
                            <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                                <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/message/proposition/confirmation">
                                    {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                                    <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="message_id" value="{{ row.message.id }}">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="candidate_id" value="{{ candidate.id }}">
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary">Rattacher</button>
                                </form>
                                <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/message/proposition/rejet">
                                    {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                                    <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="message_id" value="{{ row.message.id }}">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="candidate_id" value="{{ candidate.id }}">
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">Écarter</button>
                                </form>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    {% endfor %}
                </div>
            {% endfor %}
            <p class="form-text">
                Écarter une proposition est définitif ; le message reste dans le courrier de l'unité
                jusqu'au terme du délai de conservation.
            </p>
        {% endif %}

        {% if messages is empty and message_propositions is empty %}
            {% include 'partials/empty_state.html.twig' with {
                message: "Aucun message n'a encore été rattaché à cette réservation.",
                compact: true,
            } only %}
        {% else %}
            {% for message in messages %}
                <div class="border rounded p-3 mb-3">
                    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between gap-2 mb-2">
                        <div class="min-w-0">
                            <strong>{{ message.displayFrom }}</strong>
                            <div class="form-text mb-0">
                                {{ message.sentAt|datetime_fr }}
                                {% if message.toEmails is not empty %}
                                    · à {{ message.toEmails|join(', ') }}
                                {% endif %}
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            {% if message.linkOrigin.isCertain %}
                                <span class="badge text-bg-secondary">{{ message.linkOrigin.label }}</span>
                            {% else %}
                                {# Said out loud, not buried: this one could be wrong. #}
                                <span class="badge text-bg-warning">
                                    Rattachement incertain · {{ message.linkOrigin.label }}
                                </span>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="fw-semibold mb-2">{{ message.subject ?: 'Sans objet' }}</div>

                    {# Folded: a booking's page is long already, and a thread of
                       five replies expanded in monospace was most of it. #}
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        {% include '@inbound_mail/partials/message_body.html.twig' with { message: message, folded: true } only %}
                    </div>

                    {% if message.hasAttachments %}
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <div class="form-text mb-1">Pièces jointes</div>
                            <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0">
                                {% for attachment in message.attachments %}
                                    {% set document = message_documents[attachment.fileId] ?? null %}
                                    <li class="d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                                        <span>{{ attachment.filename }}</span>
                                        <span class="text-body-secondary small">{{ attachment.sizeBytes|filesize }}</span>
                                        {% if document %}
                                            <span class="badge bg-body-tertiary border text-body-secondary">{{ document.type.label }}</span>
                                        {% else %}
                                            <span class="badge bg-body-tertiary border text-body-secondary">Non classé</span>
                                        {% endif %}
                                        <a href="{{ file_url(attachment.fileId) }}"
                                           class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">Ouvrir</a>
                                    </li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                            <div class="form-text">
                                Chaque pièce jointe est enregistrée en « Non classé », en visibilité
                                interne. Reclassez-la dans le panneau Documents si elle est autre chose.
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}

                    <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                        <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/message/detacher"
                              data-confirm="Détacher ce message ? Il retourne dans le courrier de l'unité ; ses pièces jointes non reclassées quittent la réservation, les documents déjà reclassés restent.">
                            {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                            <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                            <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                            <input type="hidden" name="message_id" value="{{ message.id }}">
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-danger">Détacher</button>
                        </form>

                        {% if move_targets is not empty %}
                            <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/message/deplacer"
                                  class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 align-items-center">
                                {{ csrf_field()|raw }}
                                <input type="hidden" name="asset_id" value="{{ asset.id }}">
                                <input type="hidden" name="booking_id" value="{{ booking.id }}">
                                <input type="hidden" name="message_id" value="{{ message.id }}">
                                <label class="visually-hidden" for="move-{{ message.id }}">
                                    Déplacer vers
                                </label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm w-auto"
                                        id="move-{{ message.id }}" name="target_booking_id">
                                    {# Only bookings of assets this manager manages: the
                                       list is built from their own assets, never filtered
                                       from a global one (§7.7). #}
                                    {% for target in move_targets %}
                                        <option value="{{ target.id }}">
                                            {{ target.reference }} — {{ target.arrivalDate|date_fr }}
                                        </option>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                </select>
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary">Déplacer</button>
                            </form>
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            {% endfor %}
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</div>
